      "value": "Dude. This game has so much possabilities to be used for and what you are saying right now is: \"We should block that part that allows people to upload what they like\" I know that some things are anoying. But for example, I dont like anime and if your Idea would come through, the anime (what is like 95% of the game) would block my avatar and I only would be accepted if I upload Stuff what the community likes and not what I like. Sorry for bad english.",
