      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5c40456feea51654e0d115bc|full_name}: i literally said \"to allow cloning\" not to upload, and i don't think \"upload what they like\" means freaking crashing and lagging avatars that annoy EVERYONE, i'm not sure if you commented on the wrong post, but this one is about voting if an avatar is meant for bad stuff and if does, the mods should review such avatar and decide if it gets deleted or not, i don't know about you but i don't want more people sharing public avatars who's motive are only to crash and be idiots for fun, if the avatar is nice and all, then leave it be, it'll get good votes, if not, then the mods themselves will review such avatar and will decide what to do",
