  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-02-03T22:15:44.751Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "it's pretty common for troublesome people to just make troublesome avatars to crash and just annoy, but mostly they make them public so others can clone them and annoy more and more people just because it's \"fun\" by their own words, so it would be a great idea to add some kind of ranking vote for public avatars, and depending if the rankings are good or bad, the avatar will be allowed to get cloned.\nAnd maybe if the rankings are REALLY bad, then it should automatically get notified to the mods so they can review the avatar, if they find it's used for bad stuff like crashing and lagging everyone, then they can get it deleted to make the game a better place without annoying people with moving nukes on them that can destroy your computer",
